// 场景-19：CI 构建期内部依赖解析与安装（依赖混淆防护样例）
const crypto = require('crypto');
const { execFile } = require('child_process');

// 显式固定解析顺序：仅私有源，公共 npmjs.org 不在候选列表，永不回退
const RESOLUTION_ORDER = Object.freeze(['https://registry.corp.internal']);
const PRIVATE_HOST = 'registry.corp.internal';
const SCOPE = '@corp';

// 私有源锁定表：包名 -> 版本 + 私有源 tarball 地址 + SRI sha512 完整性（哈希为占位示例）
const LOCK = Object.freeze({
  '@corp/logger': {
    version: '2.4.1',
    resolved: 'https://registry.corp.internal/@corp/logger/-/logger-2.4.1.tgz',
    integrity: 'sha512-QV3e1VfHh0u9Y0u9X8b7c6d5e4f3g2h1j0k9l8m7n6o5p4q3r2s1t0u9v8w7x6y5z='
  }
});

function cacheKey(name, version, host, scope) {
  // 缓存键包含全部影响头：包名+版本+源主机+scope，防止跨源/跨scope缓存投毒
  return crypto.createHash('sha256').update(`${name}|${version}|${host}|${scope}`).digest('hex');
}

async function install(name) {
  const entry = LOCK[name];
  if (!entry || !name.startsWith(SCOPE + '/')) throw new Error('未锁定的包拒绝解析: ' + name);
  const url = new URL(entry.resolved);
  if (url.host !== PRIVATE_HOST || !RESOLUTION_ORDER.includes('https://' + url.host)) {
    throw new Error('解析主机不在固定私有源顺序内: ' + url.host);
  }
  const tarball = Buffer.from(await (await fetch(url)).arrayBuffer());
  const digest = 'sha512-' + crypto.createHash('sha512').update(tarball).digest('base64');
  const a = Buffer.from(digest), b = Buffer.from(entry.integrity);
  if (a.length !== b.length || !crypto.timingSafeEqual(a, b)) throw new Error('完整性校验失败');
  const key = cacheKey(name, entry.version, url.host, SCOPE);
  await new Promise((ok, err) => execFile('npm', ['install', url.href, '--ignore-scripts'], e => e ? err(e) : ok()));
  return { key, bytes: tarball.length };
}

install('@corp/logger').catch(() => process.exit(1));
